10000000  wide_run_token               a count, then that many 2-byte character codes (up to U+FFFF)
10000001  wide_run_32_token            a count, then that many 4-byte character codes (emoji, rare CJK)
10000010  left_brace_token             {  opens a body
10000011  right_brace_token            }  closes a body
10000100  left_square_bracket_token    [  opens an index
10000101  right_square_bracket_token   ]  closes an index
10000110  left_parenthesis_token       (  opens arguments
10000111  right_parenthesis_token      )  closes arguments
10001000  plus_token                   +
10001001  minus_token                  -
10001010  times_token                  *
10001011  divide_token                 /
10001100  modulus_token                %
10001101  assign_token                 =
10001110  plus_assign_token            +=
10001111  minus_assign_token           -=
10010000  times_assign_token           *=
10010001  divide_assign_token          /=
10010010  modulus_assign_token         %=
10010011  equals_token                 ==
10010100  not_equals_token             !=
10010101  less_than_token              <
10010110  greater_than_token           >
10010111  less_or_equal_token          <=
10011000  greater_or_equal_token       >=
10011001  and_token                    &&
10011010  or_token                     ||
10011011  not_token                    !
10011100  bit_and_token                &
10011101  bit_or_token                 |
10011110  bit_exclusive_or_token       ^
10011111  bit_not_token                ~
10100000  shift_left_token             <<
